    "title": "Earle alum Joseph McVay gets 2nd career TD for Vanderbilt - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Chris Hudgison ,\n9 hours ago TAMPA, Fla. (KAIT) - A Football Friday Night great found the end zone Wednesday in Bowl Season. Joseph McVay had a 16 yard touchdown reception for #14 Vanderbilt in the 3rd quarter of the ReliaQuest Bowl. The Earle native recorded his 3rd catch of his career, two of them have been for TDs. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
